pmc:ChaosMagicOrcRolePlayYieldsParticipation a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Role-play yields participation"@en, "Rollenspiel ergibt Teilhabe"@de ;
    skos:definition "Group role-play is said to increase the sense of participation in the myth."@en ;
    skos:note "The 1995 text carries the practice (pmp:ChaosMagicCondCRolePlayingMythos) but no node for the participation it is said to raise."@en ;
