pmc:ChaosMagicOrcSeclusionForDemonWork a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Seclusion for demon work"@en, "Abgeschiedenheit für Dämonenarbeit"@de ;
    skos:definition "Seclusion from others is called a necessity, as of old."@en ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:ChaosMagicOrcHowlingRetreatPreparation ;
    pm:dependentStep pmp:ChaosMagicOrcFloodingAndVomiting ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:statedNecessity ;
    pm:consequenceOfSkipping "Otherwise one's demons may derange the unwary, and one may be discovered, taken for psychotic and committed." ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:OvenReadyChaos ;
    dcterms:source "Hine, Oven-Ready Chaos, version 1.4 (on-line edition typeset by the author, text of 1992 first published by Chaos International as Condensed Chaos), Howling; read in the full text of the TealDOC conversion of 2000" .

pmc:ChaosMagicOrcDemonsDerangeBystandersCautela a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Demons may derange bystanders; risk of committal"@en, "Dämonen können Unbeteiligte verwirren; Gefahr der Einweisung"@de ;
    skos:definition "The work's demons may derange unwary others, and someone stumbling on the operator may take him for psychotic and have him confined."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:ChaosMagicOrcFloodingAndVomiting ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
