pmc:ChaosMagicOrcHabituationDishabituation a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Habituation and dishabituation responses"@en, "Habituations- und Dishabituationsreaktion"@de ;
    skos:definition "Most ASC exercises fall into inhibitory or excitatory gnosis; laboratory study over two decades is said to have isolated two key factors, the habituation and dishabituation responses."@en ;
