pmp:ChaosMagicOrcOnePointedFocusing a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "One-pointed focusing techniques"@en, "Techniken der Einspitzigkeit"@de ;
    skos:definition "Concentrate attention on one input while shutting out all others as far as possible, e.g. by mantra-yoga, breathing control, chanting, dancing or spinning."@en ;
